# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# docs/ - all developer documentation lives in one folder.
#
# Published (tracked): REPORT-DRAFT.md, report.md, ROADMAP.md, Flow.md, DEMO.md
# Local only (ignored): decision.md, learn.md, instructions.md
#
# The three local files are the day-to-day working notes: the decision log, the
# learning guide and the long user manual. They read badly out of context and
# change constantly, so they stay in the working tree and out of the history.
# Everything else in docs/ is an artefact: the college report, the bug ledger,
# the phase plan, the execution-flow map and the demo playbook, and all of it is
# reproducible from this repository's own tests and CI runs.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
docs/decision.md
docs/learn.md
docs/instructions.md

# The demo transcript is a captured recording of demo.bat, not documentation.
# Keep it local: it is read out only if the live demo dies on stage.
demo/expected.txt

